# {{ theme.name }} Slack Theme

Slack themes for {{ theme.name }}. {{ theme.description }}

## Installation

1. Open Slack and go to **Preferences** (Cmd/Ctrl + ,)
2. Navigate to **Themes** > **Custom Theme**
3. Click **Import** and paste the theme string from the file below

{% for v in variants -%}
### {{ v.variant.name }}

> [!TIP]
> Set Slack's color theme to **{{ v.variant.appearance | capitalize }}** for the best experience.

Copy the contents of [{{ theme.id }}-{{ v.variant.id }}.txt](./{{ theme.id }}-{{ v.variant.id }}.txt)

{% endfor -%}
## Recommended Settings

Enable **Window gradient** for a smoother appearance that blends the background with selected items.

